version: 1.1
desc: House by the Fen (Classic Reverb RE-01 port) by chmaha
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Fix rounding of delay lengths within 1e-5 of a half sample (now exact, as in the original).
about:
  Algorithmic reverb with a vintage flavour: size from a tiny booth to a large hall, damping, pre-delay (negative
  values delay the dry signal instead), high damping, low cut, early reflections, mix and level, plus 25 factory
  presets. Classic Reverb RE-01 is AnClark Liu's reverse-engineered recreation of a much-loved free studio reverb
  from the early 2000s; this port matches it exactly.
  Ported from Classic Reverb RE-01 by AnClark Liu (GPL-3.0-or-later) https://github.com/AnClark/ClassicReverb-RE01
  JSFX version released under GPL-3.0-or-later
  Claude generated some of this code
// Copyright (C) 2026 AnClark Liu <clarklaw4701@qq.com>
// Copyright (C) 2026 chmaha (JSFX port)
//
